WEBVTT

00:00:05.150 --> 00:00:05.850
<b>Slam</b>

00:00:10.870 --> 00:00:12.980
<i>Oh... the key.</i>

00:01:44.500 --> 00:01:49.250
<b>#05
 Shared Table</b>

00:01:48.190 --> 00:01:50.660
<i>That was close. I almost forgot it.</i>

00:01:55.110 --> 00:01:57.240
<i>I am fully aware that I'm 
prone to making mistakes.</i>

00:01:57.880 --> 00:02:04.660
<i>Which is why I associate doing new things 
more with anxiety than excitement.</i>

00:02:05.220 --> 00:02:06.680
I'm Futami, the owner.

00:02:07.170 --> 00:02:08.860
It's nice to meet you.

00:02:08.860 --> 00:02:10.440
It's nice to meet you, too.

00:02:11.240 --> 00:02:12.960
Here is my resume.

00:02:12.960 --> 00:02:14.260
Let's have a look.

00:02:18.270 --> 00:02:20.980
So you're a second-year student 
at Karatachi University.

00:02:21.250 --> 00:02:23.710
Lots of smart people go there. Impressive!

00:02:24.020 --> 00:02:25.820
Oh, it's not really...

00:02:25.820 --> 00:02:29.640
So did you know about our restaurant before?

00:02:30.010 --> 00:02:33.710
Yes. I always pass by here, 
so I'd been wondering about it.

00:02:33.710 --> 00:02:34.920
Oh, really?

00:02:35.160 --> 00:02:37.950
But my main reason for applying

00:02:37.950 --> 00:02:42.370
was because the staff meals on the help wanted flyer looked so tasty.

00:02:42.390 --> 00:02:43.600
Want to work with us at a stylish cafe?
 - 18 or older (high schoolers OK, students, freelancers welcome)
 - Hours TBD between 11:00 and 19:00 (2-3 hr a week OK)
 - 1000 Yen / hour

00:02:42.390 --> 00:02:43.600
<b>Our staff meals are yummy!</b>

00:02:44.020 --> 00:02:45.240
<i>Why would you say that?</i>

00:02:45.240 --> 00:02:46.550
<i>That's not an appropriate reason.</i>

00:02:47.010 --> 00:02:47.860
Umm.

00:02:47.860 --> 00:02:49.690
Oh yes, that flyer!

00:02:49.690 --> 00:02:52.260
One of our new hires made that.

00:02:52.940 --> 00:02:54.050
You're hired!

00:02:54.050 --> 00:02:54.730
<i>Just like that?!</i>

00:02:54.990 --> 00:02:56.130
Are you really sure?

00:02:56.130 --> 00:02:56.870
Yep!

00:02:56.870 --> 00:02:59.800
This is sudden, but do you think 
you could start tomorrow?

00:03:00.280 --> 00:03:01.760
Yes. I can do that.

00:03:01.760 --> 00:03:03.180
That's wonderful!

00:03:03.770 --> 00:03:05.700
I'm looking forward to working 
with you, Hayate-kun.

00:03:06.070 --> 00:03:07.530
<i>Hayate-kun...</i>

00:03:07.530 --> 00:03:10.420
Thank you. I'm looking forward 
to working with you, too.

00:03:10.890 --> 00:03:13.910
<i>The interview... actually went smoothly.</i>

00:03:14.280 --> 00:03:15.980
<i>That makes me more nervous.</i>

00:03:15.980 --> 00:03:17.770
<i>Starting tomorrow, huh?</i>

00:03:17.770 --> 00:03:18.910
<i>Am I going to be okay?</i>

00:03:19.800 --> 00:03:21.510
<b>Hakoniwa</b>

00:03:20.380 --> 00:03:21.500
<i>That reminds me.</i>

00:03:22.170 --> 00:03:25.490
<i>I got that coupon for 
this cafe not long ago.</i>

00:03:26.100 --> 00:03:27.310
<b>Snap
Decision</b>

00:03:26.560 --> 00:03:27.680
I'm going in.

00:03:28.060 --> 00:03:28.560
Excuse me.

00:03:30.110 --> 00:03:31.490
Are you alone?

00:03:31.980 --> 00:03:34.940
Umm...

00:03:35.210 --> 00:03:36.680
I'm a guy.

00:03:37.060 --> 00:03:40.270
I didn't mistake you for a woman
 and decide to hit on you.

00:03:37.190 --> 00:03:37.610
<b>Raise</b>

00:03:40.530 --> 00:03:41.030
<b>Crack</b>

00:03:41.350 --> 00:03:43.600
This place has been on my radar for a while,

00:03:43.600 --> 00:03:45.410
but the customers are 
mainly women and couples.

00:03:45.410 --> 00:03:47.370
I felt it's a bit unapproachable 
for a single guy...

00:03:47.880 --> 00:03:50.840
Would you maybe be okay 
with going in together?

00:03:50.830 --> 00:03:52.290
Blush

00:03:51.510 --> 00:03:53.070
Are you all right?

00:03:53.070 --> 00:03:54.950
Yes, I'm fine.

00:03:54.950 --> 00:03:57.430
<i>The way I misunderstood him 
just now was too embarrassing.</i>

00:03:58.380 --> 00:04:02.300
<i>I ended up going in and sharing a 
table with a person I'd just met.</i>

00:04:05.320 --> 00:04:08.380
<i>He seems like a chill, mature dude.</i>

00:04:08.380 --> 00:04:09.530
<i>That's so cool.</i>

00:04:11.140 --> 00:04:11.680
<b>Badump</b>

00:04:11.140 --> 00:04:11.680
<b>Badump</b>

00:04:12.140 --> 00:04:13.810
<b>Desserts</b>

00:04:12.140 --> 00:04:13.820
<b>Food  M</b>

00:04:12.140 --> 00:04:13.820
<b>Drink  Menu</b>

00:04:12.330 --> 00:04:13.800
What are you getting?

00:04:14.030 --> 00:04:16.480
I'll get an iced coffee.

00:04:16.480 --> 00:04:18.580
No, make that hot.

00:04:18.580 --> 00:04:19.650
Understood.

00:04:19.970 --> 00:04:23.400
Excuse me, could we please 
have two hot iced coffees?

00:04:23.680 --> 00:04:25.620
<i>Hot iced coffee?!</i>

00:04:25.620 --> 00:04:28.380
All right, two hot iced coffees—

00:04:29.610 --> 00:04:32.230
So two hot coffees.

00:04:32.230 --> 00:04:34.450
<i>The waitress is laughing.</i>

00:04:34.790 --> 00:04:38.830
So the small animals cafe 
really has animals.

00:04:39.190 --> 00:04:40.770
This is a completely new world.

00:04:41.260 --> 00:04:46.180
<b>Boom</b>

00:04:41.440 --> 00:04:42.800
<i>This is incredible.</i>

00:04:42.800 --> 00:04:44.520
<i>He really doesn't care 
about that flub just now?</i>

00:04:44.520 --> 00:04:46.170
<i>Or did he not even notice it?</i>

00:04:46.170 --> 00:04:48.220
<i>His face doesn't seem flushed at all.</i>

00:04:48.220 --> 00:04:49.530
<i>He is so cool.</i>

00:04:49.530 --> 00:04:53.010
I feel like I'm starting to get how this 
would soothe some peoples' hearts.

00:04:53.260 --> 00:04:54.660
You can pet them, too.

00:04:54.660 --> 00:04:55.890
Would you like to do that?

00:04:57.610 --> 00:04:59.570
I'd be scared of crushing one,

00:04:59.570 --> 00:05:01.710
so I think I'll just stick to looking.

00:05:01.710 --> 00:05:03.240
<i>C-Crush...</i>

00:05:03.240 --> 00:05:04.190
<b>Nervous</b>

00:05:03.640 --> 00:05:05.020
Got it.

00:05:05.020 --> 00:05:07.490
You don't have to restrain yourself, though.

00:05:08.790 --> 00:05:09.480
Go ahead.

00:05:10.980 --> 00:05:12.380
Would you like to hold him?

00:05:13.520 --> 00:05:16.050
Please be gentle with him.

00:05:17.310 --> 00:05:19.790
I've never held a hedgehog before.

00:05:19.790 --> 00:05:21.910
They're rather big, huh.

00:05:22.390 --> 00:05:24.960
And prickly. That hurts.

00:05:24.960 --> 00:05:27.000
<i>You look happy despite the pain.</i>

00:05:34.330 --> 00:05:35.510
<i>Blurry...</i>

00:05:37.470 --> 00:05:39.670
I finally got a good picture!

00:05:39.670 --> 00:05:41.000
That's great.

00:05:41.000 --> 00:05:41.970
It is.

00:05:42.660 --> 00:05:44.920
Mind if I go look at the ferrets next?

00:05:45.440 --> 00:05:47.910
<b>Ferrets</b>

00:05:45.700 --> 00:05:47.910
<i>I thought he was a quiet kid,</i>

00:05:48.280 --> 00:05:50.670
<i>but I guess he really likes animals.</i>

00:05:56.400 --> 00:05:57.830
It's so cute.

00:06:04.670 --> 00:06:06.820
I'm sorry, I'm the only one having fun.

00:06:07.180 --> 00:06:08.710
Please, don't worry.

00:06:08.710 --> 00:06:11.310
Just watching you is having 
a calming effect on me.

00:06:12.570 --> 00:06:15.880
So you're 20 and in university?

00:06:15.880 --> 00:06:16.760
That's so young.

00:06:17.280 --> 00:06:18.900
And you?

00:06:18.900 --> 00:06:20.940
I work in an office, and 
I'm turning 27 this year.

00:06:21.360 --> 00:06:22.570
<i>A real adult.</i>

00:06:22.570 --> 00:06:26.540
So what is your major?

00:06:26.540 --> 00:06:28.620
Economics.

00:06:28.620 --> 00:06:31.350
Economics? That's a safe choice.

00:06:32.740 --> 00:06:35.120
I didn't put that much thought into it.

00:06:36.610 --> 00:06:37.840
Other than studying,

00:06:37.840 --> 00:06:40.910
I never developed any notable 
skills in middle and high school.

00:06:40.910 --> 00:06:43.640
I just happened to get accepted at
 my current university because I tried hard.

00:06:44.310 --> 00:06:45.620
I'm sorry!

00:06:45.620 --> 00:06:47.640
This is a very dull story.

00:06:47.640 --> 00:06:50.460
You really don't have to apologize.

00:06:51.960 --> 00:06:54.010
So what brought you here today?

00:06:54.010 --> 00:06:58.900
I've been wondering what 
"comfort" is, exactly.

00:06:58.900 --> 00:07:01.220
Comfort?

00:07:05.870 --> 00:07:07.400
Well, I'm going to get going.

00:07:08.280 --> 00:07:10.380
Please, let me pay.

00:07:10.380 --> 00:07:12.590
Oh no, I'll pay my share.

00:07:14.350 --> 00:07:15.260
<i>Huh?</i>

00:07:15.260 --> 00:07:16.750
<i>I don't see my keys.</i>

00:07:17.620 --> 00:07:19.030
Is something wrong?

00:07:19.030 --> 00:07:20.850
It's my house key.

00:07:21.310 --> 00:07:22.970
I'm always losing it.

00:07:23.290 --> 00:07:25.170
Maybe because it's small...

00:07:25.920 --> 00:07:28.850
I've always sort of had 
my head in the clouds,

00:07:28.850 --> 00:07:32.620
so sometimes I worry if I can 
become a proper adult...

00:07:33.270 --> 00:07:35.180
I'm sorry, that got dark!

00:07:35.180 --> 00:07:35.850
It's fine.

00:07:36.150 --> 00:07:39.380
You can keep looking for it while I go pay.

00:07:39.380 --> 00:07:41.280
Thank you so much.

00:07:43.190 --> 00:07:44.810
<b>Hakoniwa</b>

00:07:46.310 --> 00:07:47.970
It was in my pocket.

00:07:48.660 --> 00:07:50.020
Oh, the money.

00:07:50.020 --> 00:07:52.140
Please don't worry about it.

00:07:52.140 --> 00:07:54.690
I can't have a student pay.

00:07:55.340 --> 00:07:57.390
Thank you very much.

00:07:57.390 --> 00:07:59.310
<i>Everyone's always covering for me.</i>

00:07:59.920 --> 00:08:01.230
Oh, and here.

00:08:02.530 --> 00:08:04.470
It's the stamp card for this place,

00:08:04.470 --> 00:08:06.250
and a little thank you for 
keeping me company today.

00:08:10.510 --> 00:08:12.670
They were selling them by the cash register.

00:08:12.670 --> 00:08:15.440
I figured, since it's leather, 
it could work for a guy as well.

00:08:15.440 --> 00:08:17.050
Or is it too cutesy?

00:08:17.050 --> 00:08:18.890
Are you sure about this?

00:08:18.890 --> 00:08:20.150
And why?

00:08:20.400 --> 00:08:23.180
It really is quite easy 
to lose track of small objects.

00:08:23.180 --> 00:08:26.100
Hopefully this will make your 
keys a bit more visible.

00:08:27.210 --> 00:08:29.590
And regarding what you said earlier,

00:08:30.380 --> 00:08:33.210
people often say that 
I'm spaced out as well,

00:08:33.210 --> 00:08:35.270
but I still manage to be 
a part of the workforce.

00:08:35.540 --> 00:08:38.290
So you shouldn't worry so much about it.

00:08:38.990 --> 00:08:40.250
I'll see you around.

00:08:42.230 --> 00:08:43.510
<i>He is so cool!</i>

00:08:44.720 --> 00:08:47.120
<i>Even though he can also mess up like that,</i>

00:08:47.120 --> 00:08:49.300
<i>he was really cool from 
the beginning to the end.</i>

00:08:52.290 --> 00:08:53.770
<i>I want to be like that.</i>

00:08:53.760 --> 00:08:53.850
Planner

00:08:53.850 --> 00:08:54.970
Planner

00:08:54.970 --> 00:08:56.300
Business
Card!

00:08:55.280 --> 00:08:56.290
<i>His business card.</i>

00:08:57.300 --> 00:08:58.010
Mumble

00:08:57.420 --> 00:08:59.270
We should go to that place again, together.

00:09:00.160 --> 00:09:03.380
<i>New situations always make me uneasy,</i>

00:09:03.380 --> 00:09:05.220
<i>but if there are encounters like these,</i>

00:09:05.600 --> 00:09:08.180
<i>I think I can really get into 
my new job tomorrow, too.</i>

00:09:10.650 --> 00:09:13.350
<i>That was more fun than I expected.</i>

00:09:13.620 --> 00:09:15.280
<i>Comfort, huh?</i>

00:09:15.280 --> 00:09:19.030
<i>I'm starting to understand a bit what Senpai 
meant by being comforted by looking at people.</i>

00:09:20.590 --> 00:09:22.230
<i>I'd like to see him again.</i>

00:09:23.720 --> 00:09:25.380
<i>I forgot to use the coupon.</i>

00:09:26.590 --> 00:09:29.520
<i>I forgot to put my personal contact 
information on the business card.</i>

00:11:00.010 --> 00:11:05.010
<b>Coming up next</b>

00:11:00.010 --> 00:11:05.010
<b>Things in Common</b>

00:11:05.010 --> 00:11:10.010
<b>We hope you'll tune in again!</b>

00:11:05.010 --> 00:11:10.010
<b>We hope you'll tune in again!</b>
